{"unit_id":"jisi71__dsh-memories#caveat-1","repo":"jisi71/dsh-memories","commit":"9d409102935ed5f1fdee645c129729c66d360aed","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memories 使用前须知：自动提炼会把会话中的用户和助手文本发送给宿主配置的 LLM 服务；模型路由由宿主决定，插件本身没有固定服务地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:193-212","lib/index.js:246-263","lib/index.js:346-363"]}
